[node name="basic_weapon" type="Node"]
script = ExtResource("1_qlgc1")
title = "Basic Weapon"
price = 90
description = "Basic Blaster™: Your inaugural weapon, the Basic Blaster™, is the epitome of dependable simplicity.  While this trusty firearm ensures foundational offense capability, its exorbitant cost is the direct result of industry-wide “Artificial Scarcity Events” and “Strategic Price Stabilization Initiatives.”  Purchase now—if you can afford it—and prepare for basic but steadfast service on your battlefield journey."
video = ExtResource("2_8gh2c")
unique_name = "basic_weapon"
legal_text = "[center][b][color=#5E81AC]THE BASIC BLASTER™[/color][/b][/center]
[center][i]Comprehensive Weapon Acquisition and Utilization Contract (CWAUC) v1.0.984[/i][/center]
-------------
[color=#777777][i]Effective immediately upon purchase or equipping.  
By continuing, You accept all terms, conditions, surcharges, and hidden fees.[/i][/color]
-------------
[b]1. OVERVIEW:[/b]  
The Basic Blaster™ (hereafter “The Blaster”) is a foundational weapon system, intended for initial armament but available for repurchase only under strict market constraints and scarcity protocols.
-------------
[b]2. AVAILABILITY AND ARTIFICIAL SHORTAGE:[/b]  
Due to ongoing “Supply Chain Resilience Optimization Initiatives” (Section 45F-13b), The Blaster is priced at a premium exceeding standard baseline weapon costs by a minimum of 217%. This scarcity is deliberate and non-negotiable, intended to preserve perceived value and strategic market advantage.
-------------
[b]3. USAGE TERMS:[/b]  
The Blaster offers baseline reliability, minor recoil, and nominal durability. It is not guaranteed to be effective against all enemy types, environments, or metaphysical threats.
-------------
[b]4. PAYMENT & FEES:[/b]  
Purchase includes:
• Base Weapon Price  
• Scarcity Premium  
• Mandatory Compliance Contribution (MCC)  
• Future Depreciation Fund (non-refundable)  
-------------
Failure to pay all fees may result in forced return of the weapon or “Asset Reclamation Procedures” (see Clause 8).
-------------
[b]5. DISCLAIMERS:[/b]  
The Blaster is sold “as is,” “where is,” and “with all known and unknown faults.” No warranties, express or implied, are granted for effectiveness, accuracy, or user satisfaction.
-------------
[quote][i]Note: The Blaster is the cornerstone of your armory, ironically priced beyond reason.[/i][/quote]
-------------
[center][color=#81A1C1][b]Basic Blaster™: Reliable, overpriced, and absolutely essential.[/b][/color][/center]
--------------------------"
